ne AIQ 75", "year": 2026, "rank": 25, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "change-the-world", "title": "Change the World", "year": 2026, "rank": null, "itemDescription": "<p>Minnesota-based Ecolab, which offers cleaning and sanitizing products, water treatment systems, and consulting services, aims to reduce water use. Ecolab provided its expertise in water technology and digital monitoring solutions to Moeve, a leading Madrid-based energy company, to develop a circular recycling system, lowering water use at San Roque Energy Park, a refining, chemical, and biofuel production hub in southern Spain. The system sends a reusable stream back into San Roque\u2019s operations by means of a membrane water system, ultrafiltration, and specialized chemistry. The collaboration between Moeve and Ecolab reduced fresh-water intake, and the San Roque lab was able to recycle up to 317 million gallons of water per year and cut down on exposure to risks from drought. \r\n</p>"}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2026, "rank": 280, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2026, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "aiq", "title": "Fortune AIQ 50", "year": 2025, "rank": 9, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2025, "rank": 274, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2025, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500--chemicals", "title": "Fortune Sector Leaders: Chemicals", "year": 2024, "rank": 5, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2024, "rank": 269, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2024, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "aiq", "title": "Fortune AIQ 75", "year": 2026, "rank": 25, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "change-the-world", "title": "Change the World", "year": 2026, "rank": null, "itemDescription": "<p>Minnesota-based Ecolab, which offers cleaning and sanitizing products, water treatment systems, and consulting services, aims to reduce water use. Ecolab provided its expertise in water technology and digital monitoring solutions to Moeve, a leading Madrid-based energy company, to develop a circular recycling system, lowering water use at San Roque Energy Park, a refining, chemical, and biofuel production hub in southern Spain. The system sends a reusable stream back into San Roque\u2019s operations by means of a membrane water system, ultrafiltration, and specialized chemistry. The collaboration between Moeve and Ecolab reduced fresh-water intake, and the San Roque lab was able to recycle up to 317 million gallons of water per year and cut down on exposure to risks from drought. \r\n</p>"}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2026, "rank": 280, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2026, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "aiq", "title": "Fortune AIQ 50", "year": 2025, "rank": 9, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2025, "rank": 274, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2025, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500--chemicals", "title": "Fortune Sector Leaders: Chemicals", "year": 2024, "rank": 5, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": "Fortune 500", "year": 2024, "rank": 269, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2024, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "worlds-most-admired-companies", "title": "World's Most Admired Companies", "year": 2023, "rank": null, "itemDescription": ""}, {"slug": "fortune500", "title": 